.idea

# Python bytecode from running the local test battery (harness/ + tools/)
**/__pycache__/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/*.pyc

# OpenCode — ignore local state (node_modules, bun.lock), keep agents (applies at every level)
**/.opencode/*
!**/.opencode/agents/
!**/.opencode/agents/*

# Claude Code per-machine local settings — never commit (applies at every level)
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Junie CLI — ignore session state, keep config + agents (applies at every level)
**/.junie/*
!**/.junie/config.json
!**/.junie/agents/
!**/.junie/agents/*

# Eval runner scratch — workspaces, throwaway config dirs, raw transcripts (evals/README.md)
evals/.runs/

# Dev eval runs stay local: measurements of an untagged working tree, read
# via the local TREND-dev.md during release prep, never committed (evals/README.md)
evals/results/runs/dev-*/
evals/results/TREND-dev.md
